Third-party code

This licence covers the Pico Radio sources in this repository (src/, web/,
docs/, cmake/, include/, scripts). The libraries it builds with keep their own
licences:

- Raspberry Pi Pico SDK                     BSD-3-Clause
- lwIP (via the Pico SDK)                   BSD-3-Clause
- Mbed TLS (via the Pico SDK)               Apache-2.0
- BTstack (via the Pico SDK)                Raspberry Pi licence for RP2 chips
                                            (see the SDK's lib/btstack/LICENSE)
- CYW43 driver (via the Pico SDK)           Raspberry Pi licence for RP2 chips
- FreeRTOS Kernel     lib/FreeRTOS-Kernel   MIT
- minimp3             lib/minimp3           CC0-1.0
- Helix AAC decoder   lib/arduino-libhelix  RealNetworks RPSL / RCSL
- Inter font (logo)   docs/logo/fonts       SIL Open Font License 1.1
